The above covers the CYD Club firmware's own code: the club module, the
cyd_* drivers, the SD-card updater, the demo programs and their pictures and
sounds (generated by code in this project).

The firmware images (the .bin and .fw files) also contain these parts, each
under its own licence, all of which permit redistribution in binary form:

  MicroPython 1.27.0                 MIT          (c) 2013-2025 Damien P. George
                                                   and contributors
  LVGL 9.4.0                         MIT          (c) LVGL Kft
  lvgl_micropython (LVGL binding)    MIT          (c) 2024-2025 Kevin G. Schlosser
  ESP-IDF 5.5.1 (incl. mbedTLS,      Apache 2.0   (c) Espressif Systems and the
  FreeRTOS, FatFs, littlefs)         and others    respective authors
  minimp3 (MP3 decoder)              CC0 1.0      dedicated to the public domain
                                                   by its author(s)
  chipguy CYD display, touch and     MIT          (c) 2026 chipguyhere
  MP3Player output code (ported to C)
  pye editor V2.80                   MIT          (c) robert-hh
  DejaVu Sans Mono (the updater's    Bitstream Vera / DejaVu font licence
  8x16 font, rendered from it)

Their licence texts: the MIT licence is above (each part with its own
